    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPRADESHIYA SABHA (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 36 OF 2014\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2014]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.00Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 24, 2014\n\n1Pradeshiya Sabha (Amendment)Act, No. 36 of 2014\n\n[Certified on 23rd October, 2014]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 03/2014.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PRADESHIYA SABHA ACT, NO. 15 OF 1987\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Pradeshiya Sabha(Amendment) Act, No. 36 of 2014 and shall come intooperation on such date as the Minister may appoint by OrderPublished in the Gazette.\n\n2. The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 169 of the Pradeshiya SabhaAct, No.15 of 1987 and shall have effect as section 169A ofthat Act:\u2014\n\n169A. The provisions of the proviso tosection 169 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act asamended by the Local Authorities (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 21 of 2012 shall not beapplicable to any budget or supplementarybudget to be submitted to a Pradeshiya Sabhaconstituted in terms of the results of theelections held prior to the date of coming intooperation of Local Authorities (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. 21 of 2012 and LocalAuthorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No.22 of 2012 respectively.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title anddate ofoperation.\n\nInsertion of newsection 169A inthe PradeshiyaSabha Act, No.15 of 1987.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency.\n\n\u201cTransitionalProvision\n\nPradeshiya Sabha (Amendment)Act, No. 36 of 20142"
  },
