    "chunk_size_bytes": 1970,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sivmuni Se VeheraBuddhist Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 43 of 2014.\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporation ofthe Sivmuni SeVehera BuddhistFoundation.\n\n2Sivmuni Se Vehera Buddhist Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. 43 of 2014\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014\n\n(a) to maintain the religous activities of the Sivmuni SeVehera Buddhist Centre situated at Navagampura,Ampara ;\n\n(b) to shape up the adherents of the Buddhism to ensurerighteous and religious society ;\n\n(c) to assist the relevant authorities with the consent ofsuch authorities to\u2014\n\n(i)protect sacred places and historicalmonuments related to Buddhism; and\n\n(ii)educate the adherents of the Buddhism toconserve natural resources.\n\n4.The objects of the Corporation shall be carried out insuch manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or of any Provincial Council.\n\n5. (1) Subject to the provisions of this Act, themanagement and administration of the affairs of theCorporation shall be carried out by an Excecutive Committee(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCommittee\u201d) consisting ofsuch number of office bearers as may be specified by therules made under section 7.\n\nGeneral objectsof theCorporation.\n\nManagement ofthe affairs of theCorporation.\n\nCorporation toensure noconflict withwork of Ministryor Department ofthe Governmentor Province."
