    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nMADAHAPOLA SRI RATNAPALARAMAYARELIGIOUS AND BUDDHIST EDUCATIONALDEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION) ACT, No. 6 OF 2015\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 06th April, 2015]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 11.00Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of April 10, 2015\n\n1Madahapola Sri Ratnapalaramaya Religious andBuddhist Educational Development Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. 6 of 2015\n\n2\u2014PL 006101\u20142000 (10/2014)\n\n[Certified on 06th April, 2015]\n\nL.D. \u2014 O. Inc. 23/2011.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MADAHAPOLA SRI RATNAPALARAMAYARELIGIOUS AND BUDDHIST EDUCATIONAL DEVELOPMENTFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a society called and known as the \u201cMadahapolaSri Ratnapalaramaya Religious and Buddhist EducationalDevelopment Foundation\u201d, has heretofore been establishedin Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with the saidsociety according to the rules agreed to by its members.\n\nAND WHEREAS the said society has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was established and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be for the public advantage to grant the saidapplication :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Madahapola SriRatnapalaramaya Religious and Buddhist EducationalDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 6 of 2015."
  },
