    "chunk_size_bytes": 1946,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Madahapola SriRatnapalaramaya Religious and Buddhist EducationalDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 6 of 2015.\n\nIncorporation ofthe Madahapola SriRatnapalaramayaReligious andBuddhistEducationalDevelopmentFoundation.\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort Title.\n\nMadahapola Sri Ratnapalaramaya Religious andBuddhist Educational Development Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. 6 of 2015\n\n2\n\n(hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d), and by thatname may sue and be sued with full power and authority tohave and use a common seal and to alter the same at itspleasure.\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a VoluntarySocial Service Organization within the meaning and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to bring about moral and economical progressamongst the adherents of the Buddhist faith;\n\n(b)to assist for the quantitative and qualitativedevelopment of Buddhist Bhikkus in historicalYapahuwa area;\n\n(c)to obtain advisory and financial assistance frombhikku organizations, governmental organizations,non-governmental Organizations, SasanaDevelopment Fund of the Dalada Maligawa, SriSiddartha Saranankara Welfare Foundation ofMalwathu Maha Viharaya and from foreign sources;\n\n(d)to construct a building complex with residentialfacilities for about one hundred bhikkus, endowedwith facilities for the development of activitiesrelating to Buddhism;\n\n(e)to create a life style based on righteous employmentamongst the adherents of the Buddhist faith withthe assistance of relevant authorities;\n\nObjects of theCorporation."
  },
