    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 17.00 Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 31, 2017.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 31st of August, 2017]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 16 OF 2017\n\nLocal Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 20171\n\n[Certified on 31st of August, 2017]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 35/2015\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nBe it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Local AuthoritiesElections (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 2017.\n\n2.Section 3C of the Local Authorities ElectionsOrdinance (Chapter 262) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (2)of that section by the omission of the words, \u201calphabeticalletter in English\u201d and \u201cor the alphabetical letter\u201d, appearingin that section.\n\n3.Section 3D of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (2) of that section by the substitutionfor the words, \u201cnew boundaries, names, numbers or letters ofeach ward\u201d of the words, \u201cnew boundaries, names andnumbers of each ward\u201d.\n\n4.Section 9 of the principal enactment is amended insubsection (1) by the addition of the following new sub-paragraph after sub-paragraph (iv) of paragraph (d):\u2014\n\n\u201c(iva) a public officer who is engaged in field basedactivities who has not ceased to serve within aLocal Authority area in which he seeksnomination at least one year prior to the electionto such Local Authority.\n\nFor the purpose of this subparagraph \u201ca publicofficer who is engaged in field based activities\u201d\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofsection 3C ofchapter 262.\n\nAmendment ofsection 3D of theprincipalenactment."
