    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPRADESHIYA SABHAS (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 22 OF 2017\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 12th of October, 2017]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 13, 2017\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Pradeshiya Sabhas (Amendment)Act, No. 22 of 2017\n\n2\u2014PL 010337\u20142,962 (09/2017)\n\n[Certified on 12th of October, 2017]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 51/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PRADESHIYA SABHAS ACT, NO. 15 OF 1987\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Pradeshiya Sabhas(Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2017.\n\n2.Section 4 of the Pradeshiya Sabhas Act, No. 15 of1987 is hereby repealed and the following sectionsubstituted therefor:\u2014\n\n4.(1) Each Pradeshiya Sabha shall consistof such number of members\u2014\n\n(a)equivalent to sixty per centum of thenumber of members to be electedand returned, for such PradeshiyaSabha, as specified by the Ministerby Order published in the Gazette,based on the number of wardsspecified in the Orders publishedunder sections 3C and 3D of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262);\n\n(b)equivalent to forty per centum of thenumber of members to be electedand returned for such PradeshiyaSabha, who shall be returned in termsof section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262); and\n\nShort title.\n\nReplacement ofsection 4 of Act,No. 15 of 1987.\n\n\u201cCompositionof PradeshiyaSabhas.\n\nPradeshiya Sabhas (Amendment)Act, No. 22 of 20172\n\n(c)determined by the Commissionerunder paragraph (a) of subsection (4)of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262)."
