    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nNATION BUILDING TAX (AMENDMENT)\n\nACT, No. 20 OF 2018\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 30th of July, 2018]\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 03, 2018\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nNation Building Tax (Amendment)Act, No. 20 of 20181\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 10/2018\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE NATION BUILDING TAX ACT, NO. 9 OF 2009\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Nation Building Tax(Amendment) Act, No. 20 of 2018.\n\n2. Section 3 of the Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of2009 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d)as last amended by Act, No. 22 of 2016, is hereby furtheramended in subparagraph (13) of paragraph (iv) of subsection(2) thereof, by the substitution for the words, \u201cimporterhimself.\u201d of the words and figures, \u201cimporter himself, priorto April 1, 2018.\u201d.\n\n3. The First Schedule to the principal enactment as lastamended by Act, No. 13 of 2017 is hereby further amendedas follows:-\n\n(1)in Part I of that Schedule-\n\n(a)by the substitution for the item (XLVI)thereof, of the following:-\n\n\u201c(XLVI) (a) locally manufactured coconutoil at the point of sale by themanufacturer, for a period ofthree years commencing fromJanuary 1, 2014;\n\n(b) locally manufactured coconutmilk, coconut oil, poonac,\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofsection 3 of Act,No. 9 of 2009.\n\nAmendment ofthe FirstSchedule to theprincipalenactment.\n\n[Certified on 30th of July, 2018]\n\n2Nation Building Tax (Amendment)Act, No. 20 of 2018\n\npairing, coconut shells orcoconut water at the point ofsale by the manufacturer,for a period of threeyears commencing fromApril 1, 2018;\u201d;"
