    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nVALUE ADDED TAX (AMENDMENT)\n\nACT, No. 25 OF 2018\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 16th of August, 2018]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 16.00Postage : Rs. 45.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 17, 2018\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Value Added Tax (Amendment)Act, No. 25 of 2018\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 16th of August, 2018]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 70/2016\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE VALUE ADDED TAX ACT, NO. 14 OF 2002.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Value Added Tax(Amendment) Act, No. 25 of 2018.\n\n2.Section 5 of the Value Added Tax Act, No. 14 of2002 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d)is hereby amended in subsection (15) thereof, by thesubstitution for the words \u201cdialysis and, services providedby the Out Patients Department but excluding medicalconsultation services;\u201d of the words \u201cdialysis, any healthcareservices provided by the Out Patients Department healthcare of any medical institution or professionally qualifiedperson providing such care and medical consultationservices:\u201d.\n\n3.Section 22 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in paragraph (a) of the first proviso to subsection(1) thereof, by the substitution for the words starting from\u201cshall be\u201d and ending with the words \u201cwithin Sri Lanka\u201d ofthe following:\u2013\n\n\u201cshall be\u2013\n\n(i)rupees twenty five for each suchgarment, for any period commencingprior to November 1, 2016;\n\n(ii)rupees seventy five for each suchgarment, for any period commencingon or after November 1, 2016 but\n\nAmendment ofsection 5 of Act,No.14 of 2002.\n\nAmendment ofsection 22 of theprincipalenactment.\n\n2Value Added Tax (Amendment)Act, No. 25 of 2018"
